        "problem": "Rewrite the statement $\u00ac((Q\u2228P)\u2227R)$ using De Morgan's laws.",
        "worked_solution": "De Morgan's laws state that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u00ac(P\u2227Q)\u2261\u00acP\u2228\u00acQ, \\\\ \u00ac(P\u2228Q)\u2261\u00acP\u2227\u00acQ.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we can simplify the given statement as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\u00ac((Q\u2228P)\u2227R) & \u2261\u00ac(Q\u2228P)\u2228\u00acR \\\\  & \u2261(\u00acQ\u2227\u00acP)\u2228\u00acR\\end{aligned}\n$$",
